# Changelog

## [1.3.0] - 2026-07-18

### Added
- Password generator with adjustable length (8-120)
- Password strength indicator with color coding
- Copy password to clipboard
- Password length preference persistence

### Fixed
- App crash with very long passwords
- Horizontal scrolling in password field

### Changed
- Performance improvements
- Code quality enhancements

## [1.2.2] - 2026-07-06

### Added
- Russian, Turkish, Indonesian, Korean, and Japanese translations.

## [1.2.1] - 2026-06-19

### Changed
- Translation and UI improvements.

## [1.2.0] - 2026-06-17

### Changed
- Performance improvements

## [1.1.0] - 2026-05-01

### Fixed
- Security vulnerabilities in password handling
- Improved password-based key derivation

### Changed
- Performance and stability improvements

## [1.0.1] - 2026-04-15

### Fixed
- Crash on wrong password input

### Added
- Modern UI with cards and gradients (Material 3 / Jetpack Compose)
- Screenshot protection (FLAG_SECURE)
- About screen with usage guide

## [1.0.0] - 2026-04-01

### Added
- Initial release
- AES-256-GCM encryption/decryption
- Offline operation (no internet required)
- Simple and intuitive interface
